00E67E Joypad_InitPorts sets up the I/O ports and detects an EA 4-Way Play adapter on port 2 (ram_FourWayPlay)
00E6E6 Joypad_Read4Way1 selects pad 1 on the 4-Way Play and reads it
00E702 Joypad_Read4Way2
00E71E Joypad_Read4Way3
00E73A Joypad_Read4Way4
016FA6 TeamArtTable 6 groups of 31 pointers (team name banner, logo, icon; two team orderings each)
01728E VBlank_Main DMA transfers, palette fade, frame counter, sound update
018F30 Main_Init main program entry after the boot checks: clears work RAM, loads the sound driver, inits hardware and jumps to the title loop
01FFF6 Palette_WaitFade installs VBlank_Simple and waits until the fade finished
020026 Palette_FadeStep called every VBlank while ram_FadeCounter >= 0: steps CRAM towards ram_PaletteBuffer
0200B4 Palette_LoadImmediate
0200F6 Random d0 = random number below the word pushed on the stack (seed in ram_RandomSeed)
02012E ISqrt d0 = integer square root of d0
020314 Joypad_ReadAll ORs the new presses of all pads (4 with a 4-Way Play)
020348 Joypad_DpadFilter
020370 Joypad_Repeat auto repeat of held directions (ram_JoypadRepeat)
020398 Joypad_Read1 returns d1 = newly pressed buttons, d3 = held buttons
0203B0 Joypad_Read2
0203C8 Joypad_Read3
0203E0 Joypad_Read4
0203F8 Joypad_Remap remaps the direction nibble through Joypad_RemapTable
020418 Joypad_RemapTable
020428 VDP_DMALocked VDP_DMASafe with the video lock flag set
02043C VDP_DMASafe like VDP_DMA but splits transfers crossing a 128K boundary
020474 VDP_DMA a0 = source, d0 = length in words, d1 = VRAM destination (pauses the Z80 around the transfer)
0205BC VDP_WaitDMA
0205CE Palette_SetAll fills the palette buffer with d0 and starts a fade
0205E4 VDP_Init clears VRAM and programs the VDP registers from the ram_Plane* variables
0206C8 VDP_SetWriteAddr d0 = VRAM address; returns a0 = VDP_DATA with the write address set
0206E2 TileMap_Draw draws a tile map (a1) of d1 rows at the text cursor, loading its palettes (mask d5) into the palette buffer
020774 Draw_RunScript runs the 8 byte drawing script placed after the call (see jmptbl_0207FA for the commands)
020784 Draw_RunScript_Worker
0207C2 Draw_Interpreter nibble coded tile row commands: copy, clear, fill, repeat
0207FA Draw_CommandTable
02099A Text_CursorToVRAM sets the VDP write address for ram_TextX / ram_TextY on the current plane
0209C6 Text_FillRect d0 = width, d1 = rows, d2 = tile
020A00 Text_PrintDigitsBig
020A7E Text_PrintCmd inline text with escape commands dispatched through Text_CmdTable
020A90 Text_PrintCmd_Worker
020B40 Text_CmdTable escape command handlers for Text_PrintCmd
020BDE Text_Print inline text using Font_Small; negative bytes set palette/plane, then x and y
020BF0 Text_Print_Worker
020CC2 Text_PrintFont inline text using the font in ram_FontPtr
020CD4 Text_PrintFont_Worker
020E6C Num_ToDecimal d0 = value, d1 = digits; writes the ASCII digits to ram_NumStr
020EC8 Text_AppendInline appends the inline string to the length prefixed buffer at (a3)
020ED0 Text_AppendInline_Worker
020F14 Text_PrintBig inline text, large font with per character tile pairs
020F26 Text_PrintHud inline text using the font in ram_FontPtr2 (scoreboard / HUD)
020F38 Text_PrintNarrow inline text using Font_Narrow
020F4E Text_PrintNarrow_Worker
02117C Text_PrintScoreboard inline text using Font_Scoreboard
02118E Text_PrintScoreboardAlt inline text using Art_1B5AEA
0211A0 Text_PrintScoreboard_Worker
0211BC Text_PrintScoreboardAlt_Worker
0211D8 Text_PrintBig_Worker
022A76 List_Skip skips d0 entries of a list of word length prefixed records at a1
024D92 NullSub
0257AE VBlank_InGame as VBlank_Main plus game timer handling
0258A0 VBlank_Simple palette fade only (installed while waiting for fades)
0258C0 Int_Null rte for unused interrupts and the level 4 (horizontal) interrupt
