ram:FF0000 SaveDataMirror copy of the battery backup save area
ram:FFB002 HScrollTableAddr VRAM address of the horizontal scroll table
ram:FFB004 PlaneAAddr VRAM address of plane A
ram:FFB006 PlaneSize
ram:FFB008 SpriteTableAddr VRAM address of the sprite attribute table
ram:FFB00C PlaneBAddr VRAM address of plane B
ram:FFB010 FontPtr2 tile set used by Text_PrintHud / Text_PrintNarrow
ram:FFB01C FontTileBase
ram:FFB042 TextX text cursor column
ram:FFB044 TextY text cursor row
ram:FFB046 TextAttr palette / priority bits ORed into text tiles
ram:FFB048 TextPlaneOffset offset into the plane table for the text plane
ram:FFB054 FrameCounter incremented every vertical interrupt
ram:FFB058 JoypadRepeat auto repeat timer
ram:FFBD3E FadeCounter palette fade step counter (-1 = idle, $64 = load immediately)
ram:FFBD40 PaletteBuffer 64 colour words (target CRAM contents)
ram:FFBF24 JoypadHeld1 previous button state of pad 1
ram:FFBF26 JoypadHeld2
ram:FFBF28 JoypadHeld3
ram:FFBF2A JoypadHeld4
ram:FFBF2C JoypadPort1 byte: port selector for pad 1
ram:FFBF2D JoypadPort2
ram:FFBF2E JoypadPort3
ram:FFBF2F JoypadPort4
ram:FFBF8A FontTileBaseAlt
ram:FFBF8C FontPtr tile set used by Text_PrintFont
ram:FFBFB4 VideoFlags bit 0 = DMA list pending, bit 2 = video lock (no DMA from VBlank), bit 1/5 = display mode
ram:FFC058 NumStrLen length of the decimal string built by Num_ToDecimal
ram:FFC05A NumStr decimal digits built by Num_ToDecimal
ram:FFC348 TextFlags bit 3 = use FontTileBaseAlt
ram:FFC352 SysFlags bit 6 = no battery backup
ram:FFD048 DrawScriptPtr
ram:FFD260 VBlankVector long: routine called by VBlank_Dispatch
ram:FFD26C FourWayPlay non zero when an EA 4-Way Play adapter was detected
ram:FFD296 RandomSeed 32 bit random number generator state
ram:FFD29A DMACommand VDP command word pair of the last DMA
ram:FFDDE0 SaveChecksum
ram:FFFDFC SoundLock $1234 while the sound driver may run
ram:FFFF4C SoundTick
